{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the world, there is a blacksmith who relies not on traditional techniques, but entirely on probability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although not as precise as the skills of a true craftsman, become a blacksmith who proves that, with luck alone, an ordinary lump of iron can be forged into the greatest sword.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enhancement success rates of various weapons can be increased to a certain extent through Skill Books and Gambling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain Skill Books through quests that feature a concise yet substantial storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons of a certain grade or higher that have been successfully enhanced can be stored in your inventory and sold in the shop. Sell weapons in the shop, save up funds, and collect every Skill Book.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855200?t=1751983644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855200?t=1751983644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855200/b314d58bcc184a00412f4c29a94b23e71c1077e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751983644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855200/b314d58bcc184a00412f4c29a94b23e71c1077e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751983644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the world, there is a blacksmith who relies not on traditional techniques, but entirely on probability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although not as precise as the skills of a true craftsman, become a blacksmith who proves that, with luck alone, an ordinary lump of iron can be forged into the greatest sword.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enhancement success rates of various weapons can be increased to a certain extent through Skill Books and Gambling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain Skill Books through quests that feature a concise yet substantial storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons of a certain grade or higher that have been successfully enhanced can be stored in your inventory and sold in the shop. Sell weapons in the shop, save up funds, and collect every Skill Book.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Hestia Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855200/7ce1780ccb5d82fdcf150238fccd283cfd733705/header.jpg?t=1751983644","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3855200/2010648554/5b9f9322488e0dbdbc949918fae94e916766f544/1751447817/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751983309","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3855200/2010648554/5b9f9322488e0dbdbc949918fae94e916766f544/1751447817/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751983309","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3855200/2010648554/5b9f9322488e0dbdbc949918fae94e916766f544/1751447817/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751983309","id":257164432,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164432/movie480.mp4?t=1751983309","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257164432/movie_max.mp4?t=1751983309"},"name":"Black Smith : The Gambler","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164432/bea582ccc7ab85c7885280828fb1134a01ba1fb0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751983309","webm":{"4